1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Autonomous agents can create campaigns in seconds,
but they still lack a safe way to license creator-owned work.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:13,000
OwnTerms is a machine-readable rights and settlement rail
for the agentic economy.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Creators define permissions and prices. Agents describe intended use.
AI extracts facts, and deterministic code enforces policy.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Each successful clearance becomes
a tamper-evident rights receipt.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
This is Night Market Signals,
an original project-owned demo asset.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The request: a 30-day Instagram campaign in India and Singapore,
an $80 budget, and no AI training.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Gemini is quarantined to factual extraction only.
This recorded run visibly labels the rate-limit fallback.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The model has zero authority over price,
permissions, or payment.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:03,000
The deterministic engine compares the request
with creator-authored policies.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Editorial blocks paid ads. Extended is over budget.
Commercial Social is the exact compatible tier at $69.

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:18,000
This recording uses the deterministic judge fixture,
clearly labeled throughout.

12
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:26,000
The sandbox path uses official PayPal Smart Buttons,
server-created Orders v2, buyer approval, and read-back verification.

13
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Fixture data is never presented
as live PayPal revenue.

14
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Settlement creates a machine-readable receipt
with granted scope and a canonical SHA-256 digest.

15
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Change even one value and verification fails.
Restore the original data and integrity passes again.

16
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:56,000
The AG Grid Community control room
audits every license by provenance.

17
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:03,000
The rights coverage matrix shows exact channel
and territory combinations already licensed.

18
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:07,300
Use creator work only after the terms are understood,
the policy matches, and the license is settled.
